    "detailed_description": "<i><strong>Handyman</strong></i> is a game where you have to lead a one-man repair and cleaning team. The main tasks are set by the customer, but what methods to achieve them - you can decide for yourself!<br><br>Each completed task will bring you a certain amount of money, for which in the next order it will be possible to do something that would not have been enough initially. For example, hang a new chandelier, and not just screw in a light bulb.<br><br>You, as a worker, are not limited by anything: you can simply make cosmetic repairs, or you can break some walls and build new ones where you see fit.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">List of your best friends for lead time:</h2>- Roller, for painting any surfaces<br>- Hammer, to create the passages you need<br>- Mop and hose, to remove unclean deeds of customers<br>- Tablet, to buy any object from any part of the world<br>- Lawn mower to mow the dense thickets of some customers<br>- Spatula and bricks to create new partitions<br>- A shovel to clean up age-old landfills<br>- As well as your hands and head to carry objects and choose the best ways to solve the tasks<br><br>And now it's time to finally establish your team, from one person! <i>Have fun.</i><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131050/extras/136f960606b18d782cfa2da8a4174c82.avif?t=1663225404\" /></div>",
